{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121051","id":4008204837,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7u6Fol","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121051","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121051.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121051.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121051","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121051/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121051/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121051/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/074919e95ca34c34142df38b5eaf17f842030e8e","number":121051,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Inherit untyped override return types in GDScript exports","user":{"login":"KurodaKayn","id":146511017,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLuUqQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146511017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn","html_url":"https://github.com/KurodaKayn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KurodaKayn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #121047\r\n\r\nUntyped GDScript overrides now inherit the parent method return type in export templates too, matching editor behavior.\r\n\r\nThe editor-only signature checks remain guarded by TOOLS_ENABLED.\r\n\r\nIf you want to verify,  you may add this piece of test code in modules/gdscript/tests/gdscript_test_runner_suite.h(generated by gpt5.5, prompt:`i've fixedd https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121047 in this branch. plz generate a test to verify whether it successfully fixes the issue`)\r\n```cpp\r\nTEST_CASE(\"[Modules][GDScript] Untyped overrides inherit parent return type\") {\r\n\tGDScriptLanguage::get_singleton()->init();\r\n\tRef<GDScript> gdscript = memnew(GDScript);\r\n\tgdscript->set_source_code(R\"(\r\nextends RefCounted\r\n\r\nclass Base:\r\n\tfunc value(_arg: Variant) -> int:\r\n\t\treturn 0\r\n\r\nclass Child extends Base:\r\n\tfunc value(arg: Variant):\r\n\t\treturn arg\r\n\r\nfunc get_child_value(arg: Variant) -> Variant:\r\n\treturn Child.new().value(arg)\r\n)\");\r\n\tERR_PRINT_OFF;\r\n\tconst Error error = gdscript->reload();\r\n\tERR_PRINT_ON;\r\n\tCHECK_MESSAGE(error == OK, \"The script should parse successfully.\");\r\n\r\n\tRef<RefCounted> ref_counted = memnew(RefCounted);\r\n\tref_counted->set_script(gdscript);\r\n\r\n\tVariant arg = String(\"not an integer\");\r\n\tconst Variant *args[] = { &arg };\r\n\tCallable::CallError call_error;\r\n\r\n\tERR_PRINT_OFF;\r\n\tVariant result = ref_counted->callp(\"get_child_value\", args, 1, call_error);\r\n\tERR_PRINT_ON;\r\n\r\n\tCHECK_MESSAGE(call_error.error == Callable::CallError::CALL_OK, \"The script function should be callable.\");\r\n\tCHECK_MESSAGE(result.get_type() == Variant::INT, \"The inherited return type should validate the override result.\");\r\n\tCHECK_MESSAGE(int(result) == 0, \"Invalid values should be replaced with the default int value.\");\r\n}\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10951989861,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACjMoaZQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.7","name":"cherrypick:4.7","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.7.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht